#: encoder.cpp:303
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The selected encoder was not found.\n"
"The wav file has been removed. Command was: %1"
msgstr ""
"រក​មិន​ឃើញ​អ៊ិនកូឌ័រ​ដែល​បាន​ជ្រើស ។ \n"
